{"data": [{"author_id": "1353836358901501952", "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:51:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117343929960112486"], "id": "2117343929960112486", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3126, "impression_count": 330981, "like_count": 4033, "quote_count": 80, "reply_count": 215, "retweet_count": 215}, "text": "Applications are now open for the Anthropic Residency, a paid, fixed-term research program for academics, technical founders, and staff-level engineers who want to make AI safe and beneficial for everyone. No ML background is required.\n\nApply by November 22:", "url": "https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2117343929960112486"}, {"author_id": "12497", "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:24:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117337139633607167"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "I was reminded today of AI Adoption Rate Trending Down for Large Companies, a chart produced by Apollo Global Management in September 2025, which appeared to show a slowdown in …", "display_url": "simonwillison.net/2026/Nov/2/cen…", "end": 248, "expanded_url": "https://simonwillison.net/2026/Nov/2/census-bureau-super-intelligence/", "images": [{"height": 1440, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117269276340199424/doMwTuPs?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 2520}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117269276340199424/doMwTuPs?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 225, "status": 200, "title": "The U.S. Census Bureau and “Super Intelligence”", "unwound_url": "https://simonwillison.net/2026/Nov/2/census-bureau-super-intelligence/", "url": "https://t.co/YEu1tnWweT"}]}, "id": "2117337139633607167", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 28, "impression_count": 18041, "like_count": 83, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 21, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "In updating a graphic showing U.S. company AI adoption over time according to a long-running U.S. Census Bureau survey, I found out that the Bureau's work has been sullied by that asinine \"Super Intelligence\" executive order https://t.co/YEu1tnWweT", "url": "https://x.com/simonw/status/2117337139633607167"}, {"author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-11-02T18:01:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117316103546294587"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/electron_cowbo…", "end": 282, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/electron_cowboy/status/2116251613669257596?a=C87sBZxVxgnPsL-HRRA&s=46", "start": 259, "url": "https://t.co/fPo1K2GXyy"}]}, "id": "2117316103546294587", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 65, "impression_count": 24214, "like_count": 147, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 6}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116251613669257596", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🚨🚨CRUSOE IS NOW BUILDING ITS OWN MEDIUM VOLTAGE SWITCHGEAR🚨🚨⠀\n\nCrusoe says building its own medium-voltage (MV) switchgear cuts lead times by 40%. We think owning the gear on the critical path is becoming one of the ways neoclouds get to power faster. (1/7)🧵 https://t.co/fPo1K2GXyy", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2117316103546294587"}, {"author_id": "4398626122", "created_at": "2026-11-02T17:27:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117307611338997846"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Q2EfGvHJpA", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2117307611338997846/video/1", "media_key": "13_2117307511820754944", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/Q2EfGvHJpA"}]}, "id": "2117307611338997846", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 928, "impression_count": 349604, "like_count": 4108, "quote_count": 184, "reply_count": 451, "retweet_count": 257}, "text": "For AGI to benefit all of humanity, it should help people with the everyday tasks that matter most to them. So we built LifeVal, a new benchmark shaped by feedback from thousands of ChatGPT users on where they most want help from a personal assistant—from finding childcare to https://t.co/Q2EfGvHJpA", "url": "https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2117307611338997846"}, {"author_id": "2465283662", "created_at": "2026-11-02T16:42:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117296318779723877"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Join the discussion on this paper page", "display_url": "huggingface.co/papers/2610.31…", "end": 124, "expanded_url": "https://huggingface.co/papers/2610.31222", "images": [{"height": 648, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117296320491003904/lZOmu9tR?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117296320491003904/lZOmu9tR?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 101, "status": 200, "title": "Paper page - GLOW-FM: Efficient Generative Low-Light Image Enhancement with One-Step Latent Flow Matching", "unwound_url": "https://huggingface.co/papers/2610.31222", "url": "https://t.co/mGdDbTZcyE"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/2nMa6EIHFw", "end": 148, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2117296318779723877/video/1", "media_key": "13_2117296232930623488", "start": 125, "url": "https://t.co/2nMa6EIHFw"}]}, "id": "2117296318779723877", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 25, "impression_count": 5767, "like_count": 25, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "GLOW-FM\n\nEfficient Generative Low-Light Image Enhancement with One-Step Latent Flow Matching\n\npaper: https://t.co/mGdDbTZcyE https://t.co/2nMa6EIHFw", "url": "https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2117296318779723877"}, {"author_id": "2939913921", "created_at": "2026-11-02T15:13:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117273926380462271"], "id": "2117273926380462271", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 10896, "like_count": 82, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "It's unbelievable that many hotels have worse wifi than United Starlink", "url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2117273926380462271"}, {"author_id": "985281530070265862", "created_at": "2026-11-02T03:12:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117092550842683671"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/SemiAnalysis_/…", "end": 172, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2117075900575477855", "start": 149, "url": "https://t.co/1sKDEsLQyu"}]}, "id": "2117092550842683671", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 255, "impression_count": 184604, "like_count": 1832, "quote_count": 25, "reply_count": 115, "retweet_count": 119}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117075900575477855", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Official apology to Google from me, they cooked with Carbon.\nIt's spikier in terms of domains and capabilities, but it's really good in a few areas. https://t.co/1sKDEsLQyu", "url": "https://x.com/dylan522p/status/2117092550842683671"}, {"author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-11-02T02:06:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117075900575477855"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/RNnkcuUkih", "end": 217, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2117075900575477855/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117075897945665537", "start": 194, "url": "https://t.co/RNnkcuUkih"}]}, "id": "2117075900575477855", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1232, "impression_count": 1402914, "like_count": 3006, "quote_count": 405, "reply_count": 318, "retweet_count": 292}, "text": "Today we’re releasing GDPx, a benchmark for measuring agentic capabilities across the most valuable domains.\n\nGDPx is a true frontier-level benchmark: even the best model scores just 12% (1/7)🧵 https://t.co/RNnkcuUkih", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2117075900575477855"}, {"author_id": "2939913921", "created_at": "2026-11-02T01:26:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117065900688118087"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/bookwormengr/s…", "end": 261, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/bookwormengr/status/2116705246856741114", "start": 238, "url": "https://t.co/hGkXPjQtug"}]}, "id": "2117065900688118087", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 204, "impression_count": 21689, "like_count": 197, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 16}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116705246856741114", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is a good post.\nThe reality is that the AI build is pricing in more markets to emerge, and AI has continued to deliver them over the last few years. Timing is everything -- the markets could come well after the compute comes online. https://t.co/hGkXPjQtug", "url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2117065900688118087"}, {"author_id": "86351835", "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:18:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117048647598968954"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 261, "start": 246, "tag": "VOTENATURE2026"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/KbAhrB1ofL", "end": 285, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jackclarkSF/status/2117048647598968954/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117048628078620672", "start": 262, "url": "https://t.co/KbAhrB1ofL"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/KbAhrB1ofL", "end": 285, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jackclarkSF/status/2117048647598968954/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117048628066099200", "start": 262, "url": "https://t.co/KbAhrB1ofL"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/KbAhrB1ofL", "end": 285, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jackclarkSF/status/2117048647598968954/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117048628091179008", "start": 262, "url": "https://t.co/KbAhrB1ofL"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/KbAhrB1ofL", "end": 285, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jackclarkSF/status/2117048647598968954/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117048628162494464", "start": 262, "url": "https://t.co/KbAhrB1ofL"}]}, "id": "2117048647598968954", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 23, "impression_count": 17875, "like_count": 239, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 20, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Hiked Mt Diablo this weekend. It's an uncompromising place, full of secrets, vast and unfairly obscure. I saw coyotes and little bunnies and picked my way across a ridge, scrabbling on rocks that were so sharp and jagged they almost drew blood.  #VOTENATURE2026 https://t.co/KbAhrB1ofL", "url": "https://x.com/jackclarkSF/status/2117048647598968954"}, {"author_id": "86351835", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:33:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117007176971825571"], "id": "2117007176971825571", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 16076, "like_count": 97, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Best summary of juggling a toddler with a baby is finding a suspicious puddle of liquid in a bathroom and attending to it, then texting my wife \"just cleaned it up. Good news - it was water, not piss!\"", "url": "https://x.com/jackclarkSF/status/2117007176971825571"}, {"author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-11-01T18:51:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116966274060165561"], "id": "2116966274060165561", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 48, "impression_count": 32584, "like_count": 106, "quote_count": 13, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "The Datacenter Backlash Goes Bipartisan: \nNext Week's Midterms and the 2028 Buildout\n2027 is largely locked in. 2028 is less secure:\na prolonged Texas permit freeze is now the biggest single risk to the US buildout,\nand both parties are running on tighter rules", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2116966274060165561"}, {"author_id": "33836629", "created_at": "2026-11-01T18:14:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116957135661945283"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The YouTube videos that Hacker News keeps telling each other to watch.", "display_url": "hackertube.org", "end": 267, "expanded_url": "https://hackertube.org/", "start": 244, "status": 200, "title": "HackerTube", "unwound_url": "https://hackertube.org/", "url": "https://t.co/xULTGY6VhH"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/QRq80bJo4o", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/karpathy/status/2116957135661945283/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116946614682263552", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/QRq80bJo4o"}]}, "id": "211695713